{"n":79,"ar":"النازعات","name":"An-Nazi'at","mean":"Those who drag forth","type":"meccan","v":[{"a":["وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَٰتِ","غَرۡقࣰا"],"w":["By those who extract","violently"],"t":["wal-nāziʿāti","gharqan"],"p":[1,2],"en":"By those [angels] who extract with violence"},{"a":["وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَٰتِ","نَشۡطࣰا"],"w":["And those who draw out","gently"],"t":["wal-nāshiṭāti","nashṭan"],"p":[1,2],"en":"And [by] those who remove with ease"},{"a":["وَٱلسَّـٰبِحَٰتِ","سَبۡحࣰا"],"w":["And those who glide","swimming"],"t":["wal-sābiḥāti","sabḥan"],"p":[1,2],"en":"And [by] those who glide [as if] swimming"},{"a":["فَٱلسَّـٰبِقَٰتِ","سَبۡقࣰا"],"w":["And those who race each other","(in) a race"],"t":["fal-sābiqāti","sabqan"],"p":[1,2],"en":"And those who race each other in a race"},{"a":["فَٱلۡمُدَبِّرَٰتِ","أَمۡرࣰا"],"w":["And those who arrange","(the) matter"],"t":["fal-mudabirāti","amran"],"p":[1,2],"en":"And those who arrange [each] matter"},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","تَرۡجُفُ","ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ"],"w":["(The) Day","will quake","the quaking one"],"t":["yawma","tarjufu","l-rājifatu"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"On the Day the blast [of the Horn] will convulse [creation]"},{"a":["تَتۡبَعُهَا","ٱلرَّادِفَةُ"],"w":["Follows it","the subsequent"],"t":["tatbaʿuhā","l-rādifatu"],"p":[1,2],"en":"There will follow it the subsequent [one]"},{"a":["قُلُوبࣱ","يَوۡمَئِذࣲ","وَاجِفَةٌ"],"w":["Hearts","that Day","will palpitate"],"t":["qulūbun","yawma-idhin","wājifatun"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble"},{"a":["أَبۡصَٰرُهَا","خَٰشِعَةࣱ"],"w":["Their eyes","humbled"],"t":["abṣāruhā","khāshiʿatun"],"p":[1,2],"en":"Their eyes humbled"},{"a":["يَقُولُونَ","أَءِنَّا","لَمَرۡدُودُونَ","فِي","ٱلۡحَافِرَةِ"],"w":["They say","Will we","indeed be returned","to","the former state"],"t":["yaqūlūna","a-innā","lamardūdūna","fī","l-ḥāfirati"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"They are [presently] saying, \"Will we indeed be returned to [our] former state [of life]"},{"a":["أَءِذَا","كُنَّا","عِظَٰمࣰا","نَّخِرَةࣰ"],"w":["What! When","we are","bones","decayed"],"t":["a-idhā","kunnā","ʿiẓāman","nakhiratan"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Even if we should be decayed bones"},{"a":["قَالُواْ","تِلۡكَ","إِذࣰا","كَرَّةٌ","خَاسِرَةࣱ"],"w":["They say","This","then","(would be) a return","losing"],"t":["qālū","til'ka","idhan","karratun","khāsiratun"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"They say, \"That, then, would be a losing return"},{"a":["فَإِنَّمَا","هِيَ","زَجۡرَةࣱ","وَٰحِدَةࣱ"],"w":["Then only","it","(will be) a shout","single"],"t":["fa-innamā","hiya","zajratun","wāḥidatun"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Indeed, it will be but one shout"},{"a":["فَإِذَا","هُم","بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ"],"w":["And behold","They","(will be) awakened"],"t":["fa-idhā","hum","bil-sāhirati"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And suddenly they will be [alert] upon the earth's surface"},{"a":["هَلۡ","أَتَىٰكَ","حَدِيثُ","مُوسَىٰٓ"],"w":["Has","(there) come to you","(the) story","(of) Musa"],"t":["hal","atāka","ḥadīthu","mūsā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Has there reached you the story of Moses"},{"a":["إِذۡ","نَادَىٰهُ","رَبُّهُۥ","بِٱلۡوَادِ","ٱلۡمُقَدَّسِ","طُوًى"],"w":["When","called him","his Lord","in the valley","the sacred","(of) Tuwa"],"t":["idh","nādāhu","rabbuhu","bil-wādi","l-muqadasi","ṭuwan"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"When his Lord called to him in the sacred valley of Tuwa"},{"a":["ٱذۡهَبۡ","إِلَىٰ","فِرۡعَوۡنَ","إِنَّهُۥ","طَغَىٰ"],"w":["Go","to","Firaun","Indeed, he","(has) transgressed"],"t":["idh'hab","ilā","fir'ʿawna","innahu","ṭaghā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed"},{"a":["فَقُلۡ","هَل","لَّكَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَن","تَزَكَّىٰ"],"w":["And say","Would","[for] you","[to]","[that]","purify yourself"],"t":["faqul","hal","laka","ilā","an","tazakkā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"And say to him, 'Would you [be willing to] purify yourself"},{"a":["وَأَهۡدِيَكَ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","فَتَخۡشَىٰ"],"w":["And I will guide you","to","your Lord","so you would fear"],"t":["wa-ahdiyaka","ilā","rabbika","fatakhshā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And let me guide you to your Lord so you would fear [Him]"},{"a":["فَأَرَىٰهُ","ٱلۡأٓيَةَ","ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ"],"w":["Then he showed him","the sign","the great"],"t":["fa-arāhu","l-āyata","l-kub'rā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And he showed him the greatest sign"},{"a":["فَكَذَّبَ","وَعَصَىٰ"],"w":["But he denied","and disobeyed"],"t":["fakadhaba","waʿaṣā"],"p":[1,2],"en":"But Pharaoh denied and disobeyed"},{"a":["ثُمَّ","أَدۡبَرَ","يَسۡعَىٰ"],"w":["Then","he turned his back","striving"],"t":["thumma","adbara","yasʿā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"Then he turned his back, striving"},{"a":["فَحَشَرَ","فَنَادَىٰ"],"w":["And he gathered","and called out"],"t":["faḥashara","fanādā"],"p":[1,2],"en":"And he gathered [his people] and called out"},{"a":["فَقَالَ","أَنَا۠","رَبُّكُمُ","ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ"],"w":["Then he said","I am","your Lord","the Most High"],"t":["faqāla","anā","rabbukumu","l-aʿlā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And said, \"I am your most exalted lord"},{"a":["فَأَخَذَهُ","ٱللَّهُ","نَكَالَ","ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","وَٱلۡأُولَىٰٓ"],"w":["So seized him","Allah","(with) an exemplary punishment","(for) the last","and the first"],"t":["fa-akhadhahu","l-lahu","nakāla","l-ākhirati","wal-ūlā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"So Allah seized him in exemplary punishment for the last and the first [transgression]"},{"a":["إِنَّ","فِي","ذَٰلِكَ","لَعِبۡرَةࣰ","لِّمَن","يَخۡشَىٰٓ"],"w":["Indeed","in","that","surely (is) a lesson","for whoever","fears"],"t":["inna","fī","dhālika","laʿib'ratan","liman","yakhshā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"Indeed in that is a warning for whoever would fear [Allah]"},{"a":["ءَأَنتُمۡ","أَشَدُّ","خَلۡقًا","أَمِ","ٱلسَّمَآءُۚ","بَنَىٰهَا"],"w":["Are you","a more difficult","creation","or","the heaven","He constructed it"],"t":["a-antum","ashaddu","khalqan","ami","l-samāu","banāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"en":"Are you a more difficult creation or is the heaven? Allah constructed it"},{"a":["رَفَعَ","سَمۡكَهَا","فَسَوَّىٰهَا"],"w":["He raised","its ceiling","and proportioned it"],"t":["rafaʿa","samkahā","fasawwāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"He raised its ceiling and proportioned it"},{"a":["وَأَغۡطَشَ","لَيۡلَهَا","وَأَخۡرَجَ","ضُحَىٰهَا"],"w":["And He darkened","its night","and brought out","its brightness"],"t":["wa-aghṭasha","laylahā","wa-akhraja","ḍuḥāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And He darkened its night and extracted its brightness"},{"a":["وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ","بَعۡدَ","ذَٰلِكَ","دَحَىٰهَآ"],"w":["And the earth","after","that","He spread it"],"t":["wal-arḍa","baʿda","dhālika","daḥāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And after that He spread the earth"},{"a":["أَخۡرَجَ","مِنۡهَا","مَآءَهَا","وَمَرۡعَىٰهَا"],"w":["He brought forth","from it","its water","and its pasture"],"t":["akhraja","min'hā","māahā","wamarʿāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"He extracted from it its water and its pasture"},{"a":["وَٱلۡجِبَالَ","أَرۡسَىٰهَا"],"w":["And the mountains","He made them firm"],"t":["wal-jibāla","arsāhā"],"p":[1,2],"en":"And the mountains He set firmly"},{"a":["مَتَٰعࣰا","لَّكُمۡ","وَلِأَنۡعَٰمِكُمۡ"],"w":["(As) a provision","for you","and for your cattle"],"t":["matāʿan","lakum","wali-anʿāmikum"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"As provision for you and your grazing livestock"},{"a":["فَإِذَا","جَآءَتِ","ٱلطَّآمَّةُ","ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ"],"w":["But when","comes","the Overwhelming Calamity","the great"],"t":["fa-idhā","jāati","l-ṭāmatu","l-kub'rā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"But when there comes the greatest Overwhelming Calamity"},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَتَذَكَّرُ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","مَا","سَعَىٰ"],"w":["(The) Day","will remember","man","what","he strove (for)"],"t":["yawma","yatadhakkaru","l-insānu","mā","saʿā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove"},{"a":["وَبُرِّزَتِ","ٱلۡجَحِيمُ","لِمَن","يَرَىٰ"],"w":["And will be made manifest","the Hellfire","to (him) who","sees"],"t":["waburrizati","l-jaḥīmu","liman","yarā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And Hellfire will be exposed for [all] those who see"},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","مَن","طَغَىٰ"],"w":["Then as for","(him) who","transgressed"],"t":["fa-ammā","man","ṭaghā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"So as for he who transgressed"},{"a":["وَءَاثَرَ","ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنۡيَا"],"w":["And preferred","the life","(of) the world"],"t":["waāthara","l-ḥayata","l-dun'yā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And preferred the life of the world"},{"a":["فَإِنَّ","ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","هِيَ","ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰ"],"w":["Then indeed","the Hellfire","it","(is) the refuge"],"t":["fa-inna","l-jaḥīma","hiya","l-mawā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be [his] refuge"},{"a":["وَأَمَّا","مَنۡ","خَافَ","مَقَامَ","رَبِّهِۦ","وَنَهَى","ٱلنَّفۡسَ","عَنِ","ٱلۡهَوَىٰ"],"w":["But as for","(him) who","feared","standing","(before) his Lord","and restrained","his soul","from","the vain desires"],"t":["wa-ammā","man","khāfa","maqāma","rabbihi","wanahā","l-nafsa","ʿani","l-hawā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"en":"But as for he who feared the position of his Lord and prevented the soul from [unlawful] inclination"},{"a":["فَإِنَّ","ٱلۡجَنَّةَ","هِيَ","ٱلۡمَأۡوَىٰ"],"w":["Then indeed","Paradise ","it (is)","the refuge"],"t":["fa-inna","l-janata","hiya","l-mawā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"Then indeed, Paradise will be [his] refuge"},{"a":["يَسۡـَٔلُونَكَ","عَنِ","ٱلسَّاعَةِ","أَيَّانَ","مُرۡسَىٰهَا"],"w":["They ask you","about","the Hour","when","(is) its arrival"],"t":["yasalūnaka","ʿani","l-sāʿati","ayyāna","mur'sāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival"},{"a":["فِيمَ","أَنتَ","مِن","ذِكۡرَىٰهَآ"],"w":["In what","(are) you","[of]","(to) mention it"],"t":["fīma","anta","min","dhik'rāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"In what [position] are you that you should mention it"},{"a":["إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","مُنتَهَىٰهَآ"],"w":["To","your Lord","(is) its finality"],"t":["ilā","rabbika","muntahāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"To your Lord is its finality"},{"a":["إِنَّمَآ","أَنتَ","مُنذِرُ","مَن","يَخۡشَىٰهَا"],"w":["Only","you","(are) a warner","(for him) who","fears it"],"t":["innamā","anta","mundhiru","man","yakhshāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5],"en":"You are only a warner for those who fear it"},{"a":["كَأَنَّهُمۡ","يَوۡمَ","يَرَوۡنَهَا","لَمۡ","يَلۡبَثُوٓاْ","إِلَّا","عَشِيَّةً","أَوۡ","ضُحَىٰهَا"],"w":["As though they","(the) Day","they see it","not","they had remained","except","an evening","or","a morning thereof"],"t":["ka-annahum","yawma","yarawnahā","lam","yalbathū","illā","ʿashiyyatan","aw","ḍuḥāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"en":"It will be, on the Day they see it, as though they had not remained [in the world] except for an afternoon or a morning thereof"}]}